// Known risks: (a) Sentinel-1B failed 2021-12-23, so 2022-2024 events
// lean on S1A alone (12-day revisit) until S1C ramped up in 2025;
// (b) IMERG V07 "final" products end 2025-09-30 pending the V08
// transition -- 2026 events depend on the late/provisional runs GEE
